"The last session ended without quitting" = "上次会话未正常退出";
"Cra %@ crashed, was forced to quit or the Mac lost power. Its last minute is in the export." = "司南 %@ 发生崩溃、被强制退出或 Mac 断电。最后一分钟的数据在导出文件里。";
"Cra froze %d time%@ for a second or more" = "司南冻结了 %d 次%@，每次 1 秒以上";
"s" = "秒";
"The longest lasted %@%@." = "最长一次持续 %@%@。";
"; %d went past 2 s" = "；%d 次超过 2 秒";
"Frequent short stalls" = "频繁的短暂卡顿";
"%d pauses of a quarter second or more since launch." = "自启动以来有 %d 次 ¼ 秒以上的停顿。";
