" The longest lasted %@%@." = " 最长一次持续 %@%@。";
"Recording costs %.3f %% of a core" = "记录功能占用 %.3f%% 的单核";
"Over its %d %% budget. The numbers still hold; selfCost in perf.json says which part costs it." = "超出其 %d%% 预算。数字本身仍然有效；perf.json 里的 selfCost 会说明开销来自哪部分。";
"Cra kept working while the Mac was idle" = "Mac 空闲时司南仍在工作";
"%d %% of a core on average over %d min without keyboard or mouse input. A playing video counts too." = "在 %2$d 分钟无键鼠操作期间平均占用 %1$d%% 单核。播放视频也算在内。";
"%d page%@ stopped (“Aw, Snap!”)" = "%d 个页面停止运行（「哎呀，崩溃了！」）";
