"The Mac is running hot" = "Mac 正在发热";
"macOS slows the processor down until it cools." = "macOS 会降低处理器速度直至降温。";
"Low Power Mode is on" = "低电量模式已开启";
"Video and scrolling may be less smooth." = "视频和滚动可能不够流畅。";
"The disk is almost full" = "磁盘快满了";
"%@ free. Chromium's caches and swap need room." = "剩余 %@。Chromium 的缓存和交换空间需要空间。";
"Cra uses %@ of memory" = "司南占用 %@ 内存";
"Tab sleeping has %d tab%@ asleep." = "标签页休眠已让 %d 个%2$@入睡。";
"Pages you haven't looked at in a while (4 hours unless you change it) close, and reload when you open them. Settings ▸ Tabs ▸ Tab Cleanup can close them sooner, or when the Mac is short of memory." = "一段时间没看的页面（默认 4 小时）会被关闭，打开时重新加载。设置 ▸ 标签页 ▸ 标签页清理可以让它更早关闭，或在内存不足时关闭。";

